{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sandiegospeedboatadventures/items/2710/", "pk": 2710, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sandiegospeedboatadventures/", "pk": 1234, "shortname": "sandiegospeedboatadventures", "name": "San Diego Speed Boat Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Speed Boat Adventure Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 8, "unicode": "Speed Boat Adventure Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 100, "description": "#Your own F13 mini speed boat!\n\n##Duration\n\n2 hours (13 miles)\n\n##About\n\nFully narrated tour for 13 miles on the Big Bay. You will have a once in a lifetime view of Navy Ships, The USS Midway aircraft museum, Coronado Bridge, The famous Star of India and the historic ships of the Maritime Museum, the cruise ship terminal, Seaport Village, The downtown skyline, and all the wildlife the call San Diego Harbor home. Your adventure awaits on your speed boat adventure!\n\n##Tour Includes\n\n- Your own F13 mini speed boat\n- USCG approved life jacket\n- Instruction covering\n- Boating basics\n- Rules of the road\n- Tour hand signals\n- Professionally trained guide leading and narrating the tour\n\n![Description of image](https://d1a2dkr8rai8e2.cloudfront.net/api/file/R3VF818qRxW5MRQTieXh)", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Cabrillo Isle Marina 1450 Harbor Island Drive, Suite 205 San Diego, CA 92101", "booking_notes": "###Please arrive 15 minutes before your Speed Boat Adventure to check-in and have your electronic waivers filled out beforehand. You will check in with your tour guide at your designated tour time at the Amazon lockers on the left side of the marina building.\n\n#Buy your other San Diego attraction tickets here and save!\n\n\n[![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ckGOsKarQq6iroIwH3kd)](https://fareharbor.com/embeds/book/sandiegospeedboatadventures/?full-items=yes&flow=274406)\n\n##Location\n**Cabrillo Isle Marina**\n**1450 Harbor Island Drive**\n**Suite 205**\n**San Diego, CA 92101**\n\n##Parking: \n\n**There is paid parking available at our Cabrillo Isle Marina location Mon-Fri.  If you are joining us on a tour M-Th we offer $5 validations for the Cabrillo Isle Marina parking lot. You can also find free 3HR street parking further down Harbor Island.**\n**There is a paid lot down the street at the Sheraton that is always available.\n\n**We suggest carpooling or arranging a Uber/Lyft as another alternative to get to our location.** \n\n\n#[Click here for directions.](https://goo.gl/maps/xAIgn)\n\n[![Description of image](https://d1a2dkr8rai8e2.cloudfront.net/api/file/LztCMXcDRySSSF1BMq2F)](https://goo.gl/maps/xAIgn)", "cancellation_notes": "Activity may be canceled at tour guide's discretion due to weather conditions including heavy rain, high winds, or lightning. As safety is our top priority, weather cancellations are made on a cruise by cruise basis up to time of departure. In the rare situation the seller must cancel the event prior to departure, ticket-holders will be allowed to reschedule tickets (subject to availability), receive a gift card, or receive a full refund (including trip protection).\n\nIf an activity is cut short early due to severe weather, rainchecks will be given to all guests. Full refunds are not available after the cruise leaves the dock, but rainchecks do not expire.\n\nRefund and Rescheduling Policy\nAll sales are final, unless trip protection is purchased up front. No refunds, reissue to gift cards, or rescheduling will be permitted without trip protection.\n\nTrip Protection Policy\nTrip Protection must be added at the time of purchase. Trip Protection allows for rescheduling (subject to availability) or refund of tickets up to 120 minutes prior to departure time, for any reason. Tickets purchased within 120 minutes of cruise departure will be a final sale, and non-refundable. Refunds will reimburse for the full amount of each ticket, less the Trip Protection fees.\n\nTrip Protection is voided and no refunds will be issued if (1) guest(s) arrive and check into the cruise, (2) guest(s) do not cancel at least 120 minutes prior to the departure time, or (3) guest(s) no show without notification.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "2 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sandiegospeedboatadventures/items/2710/images/970940/", "pk": 970940, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jkzoy56QMmF8Cib3xqIk", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jkzoy56QMmF8Cib3xqIk", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sandiegospeedboatadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sandiegospeedboatadventures/items/2710/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jkzoy56QMmF8Cib3xqIk", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jkzoy56QMmF8Cib3xqIk", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/